# Accessibility (a11y) Rules

- Interactive elements must be semantic (`<button>`, `<a>`) or have `role="button"` + `tabIndex={0}` + keyboard handlers.
- Never use `outline: none` in CSS without `:focus-visible` styling.
- All `<img>` tags must include an informative `alt` attribute or `alt=""` for purely decorative images.
